f21964c1d1a2"],

Cell["\<\
In the following example, we consider a single qubit, although the number of \
qubits can be increased. Some of the calculations, however, involve high-rank \
tensors that, for systems with more than two qubits, may exceed the available \
memory. Whenever this limitation arises, it is explicitly indicated in the \
text.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990808615057325*^9, 3.990808811354905*^9}, 
   3.990809544436755*^9, {3.990810265797048*^9, 3.990810279775587*^9}, 
   3.99081033716119*^9, 
   3.99081043782353*^9},ExpressionUUID->"50cbe44a-99ab-44d6-a436-\
5da49497ffe2"],

